{
    "title": "Triviascapes: trivia & IQ test",
    "description": "Escape the ordinary and ignite your intellect with Triviascapes, your perfect destination for relaxing trivia fun!\r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in endless trivia questions that will boost your IQ, knowledge and cognitive thinking abilities. Whether you're a fan of history, geography, or science, or you're intrigued by questions about animals, food, or literature, Triviascapes has it all!\r\n\r\nThe game features a unique progression system, where each several questions answered earn you a fragment of a new stunning background. Complete the whole level, collect all the fragments and unlock a new breathtaking view right from nature's gallery!\r\n\r\nIn Triviascapes, it's okay to make a mistake. If you get a question wrong, you lose one life out of five. But don't worry! With the coins you earn along the way, you can buy more lives or even helpful hints for those tricky questions that leave you stumped.\r\n\r\nRemember, making mistakes and using hints are all part of the exciting learning journey!\r\n\r\nChallenge your mind with hard and easy quizzes as you journey through beautiful landscapes. Our educational trivia game is designed to provide an intellectual challenge for your brain while allowing you to relax and unwind. It's a competition where your memory and logical skills will be put to the test.\r\n\r\nKEY GAME FEATURES\r\n- Unique & challenging trivia quizzes\r\n- Beautiful scenery\r\n- Simple design\r\n- Relaxing music\r\n- Clear rules\r\n\r\nIts calming music and serene scenery make Triviascapes more than just a game \u2014 it's a relaxation tool designed to help you take a break from your daily routine. Expand your knowledge and enjoy the adventure with Triviascapes, where learning is fun and relaxation is guaranteed!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Escape the ordinary and ignite your intellect with Triviascapes, your perfect destination for relaxing trivia fun!<br><br>Immerse yourself in endless trivia questions that will boost your IQ, knowledge and cognitive thinking abilities. Whether you&#39;re a fan of history, geography, or science, or you&#39;re intrigued by questions about animals, food, or literature, Triviascapes has it all!<br><br>The game features a unique progression system, where each several questions answered earn you a fragment of a new stunning background. Complete the whole level, collect all the fragments and unlock a new breathtaking view right from nature&#39;s gallery!<br><br>In Triviascapes, it&#39;s okay to make a mistake. If you get a question wrong, you lose one life out of five. But don&#39;t worry! With the coins you earn along the way, you can buy more lives or even helpful hints for those tricky questions that leave you stumped.<br><br>Remember, making mistakes and using hints are all part of the exciting learning journey!<br><br>Challenge your mind with hard and easy quizzes as you journey through beautiful landscapes. Our educational trivia game is designed to provide an intellectual challenge for your brain while allowing you to relax and unwind. It&#39;s a competition where your memory and logical skills will be put to the test.<br><br>KEY GAME FEATURES<br>- Unique &amp; challenging trivia quizzes<br>- Beautiful scenery<br>- Simple design<br>- Relaxing music<br>- Clear rules<br><br>Its calming music and serene scenery make Triviascapes more than just a game \u2014 it&#39;s a relaxation tool designed to help you take a break from your daily routine. Expand your knowledge and enjoy the adventure with Triviascapes, where learning is fun and relaxation is guaranteed!",
